N5008 [dcl.init.list]/3.4: list-initialisation of a class with a
user-declared constructor selects a constructor; the memberwise
fast path is only for aggregates.  Taking it for std::pair copied a
temporary before its constructor had run (nested {"a", {"first", 1}}
into pair<const string, pair<const string, int>> lost the inner string).
